350
00:25:06.922 --> 00:25:09.925
Pero nakikita kong malaki ang pinagbago mo
simula nung huli kitang nakita.

351
00:25:10.884 --> 00:25:11.801
nakikita ko na

352
00:25:13.261 --> 00:25:14.304
