353
00:25:17.140 --> 00:25:18.225
Ngayong alam mo na, pwede ka nang umalis.

354
00:25:19.392 --> 00:25:21.311
Wala na akong interes sa mind games.

355
00:25:33.323 --> 00:25:35.242
GO YEONG-SIK
ABRIL 27, 2025

